 - "Loading customers for order..."
 - "Loading items for order..."
 - "Customers loaded: X" and "Items loaded: Y"

If you still don't see the Place Order interface, please check the browser console for any error messages and let me know what you see. The debug messages will help us identify exactly what's happening.

The Place Order section should now be fully visible with all its cards and functionality when you click the "Place Order" menu item, and the home sections (statistics, charts, recent activity) should be completely hidden.
