omers and adding items with quantities.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"d-flex align-items-start mb-3\">\n <div class=\"badge bg-primary rounded-pill me-3\">4</div>\n <div>\n <h6 class=\"fw-bold\">Print Bills</h6>\n <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Generate and print professional bills after successful order placement.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <!-- Feature Guide -->\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <div class=\"card mb-4\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-people me-2\"></i>Customer Management</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body\">\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Add new customers with unique account numbers</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Update customer information anytime</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>View all customers in organized table</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Sort customers by different fields</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Delete customers when needed</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <div class=\"card mb-4\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-box-seam me-2\"></i>Item Management</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body\">\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Add items with name, price, and quantity</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Update item details and stock levels</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Automatic stock management</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>View low stock items</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Delete unused items</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <div class=\"card mb-4\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-receipt me-2\"></i>Order Management</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body\">\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Select customer from dropdown</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Add multiple items to order</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Real-time stock validation</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>View order summary with totals</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Remove items from order</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <div class=\"card mb-4\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-printer me-2\"></i>Bill Generation</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body\">\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Automatic bill generation after order</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Professional bill format</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Customer and item details included</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Print-friendly layout</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-circle text-success me-2\"></i>Save as PDF option</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <!-- Tips and Tricks -->\n <div class=\"card mb-4\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb me-2\"></i>Tips & Best Practices</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body\">\n <div class=\"row\">\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <h6 class=\"text-primary\">\ud83d\udca1 Pro Tips</h6>\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Use unique account numbers for customers</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Keep item stock levels updated</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Double-check order details before placing</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Print bills immediately after order completion</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n <h6 class=\"text-success\">\u2705 Best Practices</h6>\n <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Regular backup of customer data</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Monitor stock levels regularly</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Use clear, descriptive item names</li>\n <li class=\"mb-2\">\u2022 Keep customer information up to date</li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <!-- Contact Support -->\n <div class=\"card\">\n <div class=\"card-header\">\n <h5 class=\"mb-0\"><i class=\"bi bi-headset me-2\"></i>Need More Help?</h5>\n </div>\n <div class=\"card-body text-center\">\n <p class=\"text-muted\">If you need additional assistance or have questions about using the system:</p>\n <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-center gap-3\">\n <button class=\"btn btn-outline-primary\">\n <i class=\"bi bi-envelope me-2\"></i>Contact Support\n </button>\n <button class=\"btn btn-outline-info\">\n <i class=\"bi bi-book me-2\"></i>User Manual\n </button>\n <button class=\"btn btn-outline-success\">\n <i class=\"bi bi-chat-dots me-2\"></i>Live Chat\n </button>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n</div>", "new_str_start_line_number": 520, "new_str_end_line_number": 656}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"Now let me add the Help Section content after the place order section:
