Customer> customers = customerService.getAllCustomers();\n responseStrategy.sendDataResponse(response, customers);\n \n } catch (Exception e) {\n responseStrategy.sendErrorResponse(response, \n HttpServletResponse.SC_INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR, \n \"Failed to retrieve customers: \" + e.getMessage());\n }\n }\n}"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"Now let me update a servlet to use the Template Method pattern:
